sequence Pay for the order

customer = Customer "pays" [color slate] [icon user]
payment = Payment "takes the money" [color violet] [icon card]

# Ask to pay
> The customer pays 1200 yen by card.
> The payment service checks the card holder before it takes the money.
`pay(1200)`
customer -> payment : pay 1200 yen
payment : check the card holder

# Take the money
> The payment service takes the money and marks it as received.
payment "received"
